### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@memberId = {{createMember.response.body._id}}

### 1. GET ALL MEMBERS
GET {{baseUrl}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. CREATE A NEW MEMBER
# @name createMember
POST {{baseUrl}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "fullname": "John Doe",
    "contactNo": "09123456789",
    "joinDate": "2024-03-12",
    "status": "active"
}

###

### 3. GET A SPECIFIC MEMBER BY ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/members/{{memberId}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 4. UPDATE A MEMBER
PUT {{baseUrl}}/members/{{memberId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "fullname": "John Updated Doe",
    "status": "inactive"
}

###

### 5. DELETE A MEMBER
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/members/{{memberId}}
Content-Type: application/json